<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's TV3 requotes at 5.60 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's TV3 requotes at 5.60 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Malaysia's private television station Sistem Televisyen Malaysia Bhd (TV3) requoted on Monday at 5.60 ringgit, off 10 cents.</p>
<p>The stock was suspended on Friday pending a news announcement. Late that day, the company said it had agreed to pay 49,000 ringgit for a 49 percent stake in Sistem Network Nusantara Sdn Bhd.</p>
